WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.900
Hi, everyone.

2
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:04.537
My name is Sally and I'm originally
from Long Island, New York.

3
00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:09.009
I'm currently a fourth year student here
majoring in Business Administration

4
00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:12.379
with an additional major
in French and Francophone Studies.

5
00:00:12.379 --> 00:00:16.316
One of the most meaningful student
organizations that I'm a part of,

6
00:00:16.316 --> 00:00:18.585
it's called Smart Woman Securities.

7
00:00:18.585 --> 00:00:21.988
And this has been such
a big part of my experiences here.

8
00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:25.358
This is a finance-focused
undergraduate organization

9
00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:29.462
with the goal of empowering more women
in the finance industry.

10
00:00:29.462 --> 00:00:33.333
Well, I really appreciate about this
is that it is not just a student

11
00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:36.836
organization where we teach you
about all the technical skills.

12
00:00:36.836 --> 00:00:39.572
We also emphasize
mentorship and community.

13
00:00:39.572 --> 00:00:43.510
So when I first joined as a first year,
it was really, really helpful to have

14
00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:47.580
older students acting as mentors,
guiding me through all the little things

15
00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:50.650
like classes
and to everything like internship

16
00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:52.919
and just overall adjusting to CMU.

17
00:00:52.919 --> 00:00:53.987
I was able to learn

18
00:00:53.987 --> 00:00:57.190
both technical knowledge
and find my community through this.

19
00:00:57.190 --> 00:01:00.627
And now as I'm a fourth year student,
I've also kind of stepped

20
00:01:00.627 --> 00:01:04.397
into the mentorship role myself,
which has been super rewarding,

21
00:01:04.397 --> 00:01:09.397
and I'm really excited to see the future
and continuation of SWS here at CMU.

